  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04AH">Lemma <span data-tag="04AH">110.53.1</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $G$ be an affine group scheme over $k$. If the stack $[\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(k)/G]$ has a smooth covering by a scheme, then $G$ is of finite type over $k$. </p>
